--- !u!114 &362921715
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 362921713}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c79ea90478561ee4bbeefe8b9451baa6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Arkasa.Runtime::Arkasa.GuideService
  voiceSource: {fileID: 1756008161}
  subtitlePanel: {fileID: 925404403}
  subtitleText: {fileID: 1726904984}
  subtitleHoldTime: 1.5
  lines:
  - id: intro
    text: Welcome aboard the orbital station. Take a moment to look around. Look
      at objects to identify them, and use the handrails to move.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bd623703f32882f499abaf3f111162b9, type: 3}
  - id: look_done
    text: Good. You are familiar with the module. We have a problem with the communications
      antenna.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 080fb6dec9264c74692d99586a464061, type: 3}
  - id: diagnose
    text: Float to the communications panel on the right wall and press the diagnostics
      button.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8993b86b3a287ea48bc36b709187e3f7, type: 3}
  - id: diagnose_done
    text: Diagnostics confirm a loose cable at the antenna base. You will need to
      repair it outside.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4917c58eb8defe64581aab7cfcfa1180, type: 3}
  - id: toolkit
    text: Collect the repair tool kit from the tool storage locker near the airlock.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6a3e2ab6926b48c47b89dcbd643d520a, type: 3}
  - id: toolkit_done
    text: Tool kit collected and stowed on your belt.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: af8a691a91ffe694f9ae19ef1552a184, type: 3}
  - id: toolkit_needed
    text: You need the repair tool kit first.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7b026a29d0797184fb387f0e2b39f7fd, type: 3}
  - id: airlock_out
    text: Enter the airlock and press the cycle button.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 68cdbae2237f53048ade49b3e405dfee, type: 3}
  - id: airlock_cycling
    text: Airlock cycling. Hold position.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: df8e1ccf9280b9b4ca072ec8857f8a48, type: 3}
  - id: airlock_occupied
    text: Move fully inside the airlock before cycling.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 42117a53ebbca5841ad9148941f7724e, type: 3}
  - id: airlock_out_done
    text: Outer hatch open. You are now outside the station.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 059bcba5343cfb548bb93a8362a2a760, type: 3}
  - id: traverse
    text: Follow the handrails along the truss to the communication antenna. Move
      hand over hand.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6b3ec2b4e7f07f04abc69443232cd0db, type: 3}
  - id: traverse_done
    text: You have reached the antenna.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1edf5d6e8c3911c41be1f8a453496938, type: 3}
  - id: open_panel
    text: Press the latch on the maintenance panel to open it.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 47b8c844af65772479a5302ca303df75, type: 3}
  - id: panel_done
    text: Maintenance panel open. Find the loose cable.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6973c0f6c09a08249b8a1aa263135072, type: 3}
  - id: reconnect
    text: Grab the floating cable plug and push it into the connection point inside
      the panel.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a86f0ef9512c7134dba2d9866572a08b, type: 3}
  - id: cable_done
    text: Cable connected.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8b54e8f74042b9b42a384e54ed5eefe8, type: 3}
  - id: restored
    text: Signal restored. Communications are back online. Great work.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5c18094cbf7150d4995841b2278bfc35, type: 3}
  - id: return
    text: Return along the handrails to the airlock and cycle back inside.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f24f92fda468b604e9a70a3e02e227d9, type: 3}
  - id: complete
    text: Welcome back inside. Mission complete.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 89c078366a5b5244f8826792424fe215, type: 3}
  - id: hint
    text: Take your time. Look around for the highlighted objective.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a189a239bdf534b4ba60034cca212872, type: 3}
  - id: paused
    text: Session paused.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ed04153900d660d45aed6bd23deb0c62, type: 3}
  - id: resumed
    text: Resuming.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 53cfbdeb26571934484e0be6e35897ac, type: 3}
  - id: estop
    text: Session stopped. Stay still. The operator will assist you.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 03fe880a243037643b0bfc7f0ab8e7c4, type: 3}
  - id: tracking_lost
    text: Tracking lost. Please hold still.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b67a959f3ba929148a16a326a932a024, type: 3}
  - id: tracking_ok
    text: Tracking restored.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: af6aefff0ccb84443a42ec1711465f71, type: 3}
  - id: hands_lost
    text: I can't see your hands. Hold them in front of you.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fcb06018db465094490abea465aaa3b0, type: 3}
  - id: tether
    text: Your safety tether is pulling you back toward the station.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 93d38dc8b16c7e4449928b6e8bfac090, type: 3}
  - id: pg_welcome
    text: Welcome to the test playground. Each station tests one feature.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5f182527e6c42d440a249d243eb4a759, type: 3}
  - id: pg_test
    text: This is a test line from the guide.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b55e651e36a78db4680dc7b70ca164a1, type: 3}
  - id: obj_window
    text: An observation window. Earth is below you, about four hundred kilometres
      away.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2fcf91053b2580f4797d126604e94834, type: 3}
  - id: obj_cabinet
    text: An equipment cabinet holding experiment hardware.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7c7c2f1aa477cf940b153509abb8dcc7, type: 3}
  - id: obj_lifesupport
    text: The life support rack. It controls air and temperature.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 40aed9d854fd1c3498dd12b2bce38e7f, type: 3}
  - id: obj_comms
    text: The communications panel. It shows the antenna signal status.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8a72792e9eb7f12439ce5451883c5963, type: 3}
  - id: obj_toolstorage
    text: The tool storage locker.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: aff95dc935aae574fb3c095b46e3012d, type: 3}
  - id: obj_toolkit
    text: The repair tool kit. It contains a driver and cable tools.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3d3bc9e9ae680e747808db122f20efb2, type: 3}
  - id: obj_airlock
    text: The airlock. It connects the station interior to space.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 815e4f907e3274d49951766ac871ebe8, type: 3}
  - id: obj_handrail
    text: A handrail. Grab it and pull to move.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8cd37b9753992fa4e8bd3074d06d34ae, type: 3}
  - id: obj_antenna
    text: The communication antenna. It links the station to ground control.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b557e2281f57e02428b41bc13aa61a89, type: 3}
  - id: obj_panel
    text: The maintenance panel at the base of the antenna.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0013b202fb6aedb45aec0a8898d46330, type: 3}
  - id: obj_cable
    text: The antenna cable plug. It must go into the connection point.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 04ee9ecfd7aba8443b7fd29b2ab60ab8, type: 3}
  - id: obj_socket
    text: The cable connection point.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 930e663ba05a9944e9a8cb27fad04b62, type: 3}
  - id: obj_earth
    text: Earth. The station orbits it about every ninety minutes.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 04ac98c8fbc68234987842b6d7087e31, type: 3}
  - id: obj_wrench
    text: A wrench. In zero gravity it keeps drifting once released.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8ab522a7bcc53ab45b67a1282b2182df, type: 3}
  - id: obj_cube
    text: A test cube.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a044dbf0512ef7b4e9335ca84c211ee2, type: 3}
  - id: obj_sphere
    text: A test sphere.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c351cca1118ca714982bcbd2639bdd14, type: 3}
  - id: obj_cylinder
    text: A test cylinder.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1272314d6da02e5458aba78ed0c90ae0, type: 3}
  - id: obj_button
    text: A button. Press it with your fingertip.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e0b44b6d2db02c546b7a878fc2cc932d, type: 3}
  currentLineId: 
  history: []
